    "body": "Thank you for the issue — the detail that a space-free TEMP directory worked was the clue that made this diagnosable, and `[local-path] 10` → `[local-path] is the whole bug in one line.\n\nThe fix is **merged** in #352: the installer was mixing 8.3 short paths with long-path APIs, so it resolved a path it was never asked to write.\n\n**Deliberately keeping this open** rather than auto-closing it. #352 was filed with `Refs #349` instead of `Fixes #349` precisely so merging would not close this before someone confirms it on a real Windows profile with a space in the path — the fix was verified by other means, not on the machine that hit it.\n\nIf you get the chance to re-run the installer on that account after the next release, a confirmation here would be very welcome and I will close it out. No obligation — I will get it verified either way.\n",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/ix-infrastructure/Ix/issues/349#issuecomment-5245023559",
